---
import Figure from "../Figure.astro";
---
<Figure width="wide">
  <div class="two">
    <div>
      <div class="fig relwrap" id="disk"></div>
      <div class="replay"><button id="play">Play</button><input type="range" id="tslider" min="0" max="1" value="1" aria-label="Attempt" /><span class="num" id="tlabel"></span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lab">Findings, by how far they travelled</p>
      <div id="findings"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="legend" id="diskleg"></div>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    <b>Culture is a tree with chords.</b> Sector = deme; distance from the centre = generation; lines join a parent to
    its child. Filled dot = still in the population, hollow = dropped, bigger = higher score. A crimson chord is a
    finding from one deme delivered to a child on another: solid if the child improved on its parent, dashed if not.
    The run replays on a loop; hover a program for its score.
  </Fragment>
</Figure>
